## Standard

This repository follows `standards/observability/observability-as-code.md` v1.0.0.

## Layout

{% if backend == 'prometheus' %}
- `prometheus/rules/` — Prometheus alerting rules (`promtool check rules`)
{% elif backend == 'grafana' %}
- `grafana/dashboards/` — Grafana dashboard JSON
{% elif backend == 'datadog' %}
- `datadog/` — placeholder for Datadog monitor JSON (expand in a follow-up)
{% else %}
- `otel/` — placeholder for OpenTelemetry Collector config (expand in a follow-up)
{% endif %}

## Usage

Deploy `prometheus/rules/` to your Prometheus ruler or sync via your GitOps pipeline.
When `backend=grafana`, import JSON from `grafana/dashboards/`.

## Validate locally

```bash
yamllint .
promtool check rules prometheus/rules/*.yaml
```

